supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Corollary 6.6.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"101"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"121"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\times\\Sigma^*\">\\(r:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\times\\Sigma^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=\\operatorname{dom}r\">\\(I=\\operatorname{dom}r\\)</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in I\">\\(i\\in I\\)</span> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r(i)=(\\ell_i,\\tau_i)\">\\(r(i)=(\\ell_i,\\tau_i)\\)</span>，且满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"eb52618778abed91\" href=\"?note=eb52618778abed91\" title=\"43-df-kc-set\">43-df-kc-set</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KC}(r)\">\\(\\mathrm{KC}(r)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall i\\in I\\;K(\\tau_i)\\le\\ell_i+c.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall i\\in I\\;K(\\tau_i)\\le\\ell_i+c.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>KC 定理给出一个实现请求的前缀机器，再用固定通用机器模拟它；常数只依赖整个请求系统。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Corollary 6.6.2；印刷页 101，PDF 页 121。来源定位沿用附件；此次修订核查形式化与内部一致性，未重新核对原书 PDF。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]",